{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-def-5","kind":"definition","title":"欧多克索斯比例定义：任意等倍数的比较","englishTitle":"Magnitudes are said to be in the same ratio, the first to the second and the third to the fourth, when, if any equimultiples whatever be taken of the first and third, and any equimultiples whatever of the second and fourth, the former equimultiples alike exceed, are alike equal to, or alike fall short of, the latter equimultiples respectively taken in corresponding order.","book":5,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.def.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.def.5/","group":"def","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":false,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-def-5@raw-c32e54eb7e0b50ae","contentId":"euclid-5-def-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c32e54eb7e0b50ae6aa6dc4cdbd8327df68f5c88f62f6bb9ac4c11f8370b10a9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-def-5.statement","euclid-5-def-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-def-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-def-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-def-5@raw-c32e54eb7e0b50ae","order":0,"kind":"definition","title":"定义陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"09477d4d9478eb24d6570453071afcfe3de83c1b8c7a090442437b1d8a72eb1d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Magnitudes are said to be in the same ratio, the first to the second and the third to the fourth, when, if any equimultiples whatever be taken of the first and third, and any equimultiples whatever of the second and fourth, the former equimultiples alike exceed, are alike equal to, or alike fall short of, the latter equimultiples respectively taken in corresponding order."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果对第一量与第三量任取相同倍数，同时对第二量与第四量任取相同倍数，所得倍量总是对应地同时大于、同时等于或同时小于，那么第一量与第二量之比等于第三量与第四量之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-def-5.source","contentId":"euclid-5-def-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-def-5@raw-c32e54eb7e0b50ae","order":1,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"389f335ce8328996c0b2e230c2a878d2c3379fa44aed4c3f84eeaa49b1ccc7bd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.def.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.def.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-4:euclid-5-def-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-4.proof.3","euclid-5-4.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-def-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"V. Def. 5"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-7:euclid-5-def-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-7.proof.4","euclid-5-7.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-def-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop